IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Instruments under the Telecommunications Act 1999 that the receiver-seat questions consult: WHICH VERSION GOVERNS A DAY, on two time axes.
-- (The design is the one in sgta-ta-versions.l4: assumed, not ruled; two plain DATE inputs because stable l4 1.6.98 has no temporal built-ins.)
--
-- Each row is {published day, effective day, version}.  The answer is the EFFECTIVE day of the version with the latest published day among those
-- published on or before the reading day whose effective day is on or before the conduct day; NOTHING when there is none.  Returning the effective
-- day lets the seat call the instruments' existing date dispatchers with it: the day of a version's own start selects that version there.
--
-- WHAT THE ROWS REST ON.  Every amending instrument's PUBLISHED day is the day in the line "First published in the Government Gazette, Electronic
-- Edition, on ..." of its e-Gazette copy, and its EFFECTIVE day is the day its commencement clause names, both read on 2026-11-04 from the copies
-- deposited under registers/source-bundle/ (the file names are TA1999-<instrument>-<S number>-GAZ.txt, or without -GAZ where IMDA's list lacks the
-- instrument).  The team lead's index dates for the 29 instruments fetched agreed with the in-PDF line in all 29 cases.  Rows whose published day is EARLIER than
-- the effective day (S 100/2016, S 20/2011, S 263/2006, S 707/2005, S 252/2013, S 651/2004, S 478/2005, S 210/2010, S 251/2013, S 726/2014, S 725/2014,
-- S 78/2017) answer differently for a reader between the two days; no instrument here has a published day LATER than its effective day.  The two
-- Revised Edition rows are Fork B of NOTES.md: their start days are assumed (the PDF does not print the day the Revised Edition began), and the
-- published day is assumed to be the same day.  Known retrospective element not modelled: S 263/2006 (Rg 5) is in operation on 1 June 2006 with its
-- regulations 6 and 10 deemed in operation on 1 May 2006 (TA1999-RG5-S263-2006-GAZ.txt); those two regulations concern the Radio Amateur Examination
-- fee and the Second Schedule.
-- S 485/2016 (Rg 3) is also retrospective (published 3 Oct 2016, deemed in operation 1 Oct 2016); Rg 3 has no version table here, and sgta-i-rg3-s485-2016.l4 carries both days itself.
-- Rg 5 before 2 March 2001 answers NOTHING (the Regulations as made, S 114/2001, are the first version; the 2001 amendments are S 339/2001, S 374/2001 and S 450/2001).
-- N 1 before 2 March 2001 answers NOTHING: the Notification as made, S 115/2001 (first published 2 March 2001 5:00 pm, in operation 2 March 2001), is the first version.

§ `N 1`

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`N 1: the effective day of the version of the Notification that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 28 8 2023)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 9 2023)) THEN JUST (Date 1 9 2023)  -- S 588/2023, first published 28 Aug 2023, in operation 1 Sep 2023 (paras 2 and 3(a), the section numbers, deemed from 31 Dec 2021: see sgta-i-n1-exemption.l4)
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 3 2017)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 4 2017)) THEN JUST (Date 1 4 2017)  -- S 78/2017, first published 1 Mar 2017, in operation 1 Apr 2017
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 31 10 2014)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 11 2014)) THEN JUST (Date 1 11 2014)  -- S 726/2014, first published 31 Oct 2014, in operation 1 Nov 2014
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 23 6 2014)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 23 6 2014)) THEN JUST (Date 23 6 2014)  -- S 415/2014, first published 23 Jun 2014, in operation 23 Jun 2014
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 24 4 2013)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 25 4 2013)) THEN JUST (Date 25 4 2013)  -- S 252/2013, first published 24 Apr 2013, in operation 25 Apr 2013
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 4 2011)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 4 2011)) THEN JUST (Date 1 4 2011)  -- S 179/2011, first published 1 Apr 2011, in operation 1 Apr 2011
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 2 1 2008)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 2 1 2008)) THEN JUST (Date 2 1 2008)  -- S 1/2008, first published 2 Jan 2008, in operation 2 Jan 2008
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 18 5 2006)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 18 5 2006)) THEN JUST (Date 18 5 2006)  -- S 265/2006, first published 18 May 2006, in operation 18 May 2006
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 26 10 2004)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 28 10 2004)) THEN JUST (Date 28 10 2004)  -- S 651/2004, first published 26 Oct 2004, in operation 28 Oct 2004
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 15 12 2003)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 15 12 2003)) THEN JUST (Date 15 12 2003)  -- S 591/2003, first published 15 Dec 2003, in operation 15 Dec 2003
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2003)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2003)) THEN JUST (Date 1 1 2003)  -- 2002 Revised Edition
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 17 10 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 17 10 2001)) THEN JUST (Date 17 10 2001)  -- S 525/2001, first published 17 Oct 2001, in operation 17 Oct 2001
       IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) THEN JUST (Date 2 3 2001)  -- S 115/2001, the Notification as made, first published 2 Mar 2001, in operation 2 Mar 2001
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `Rg 5`

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Rg 5: the effective day of the version of the Regulations that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 7 3 2016)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 4 2016)) THEN JUST (Date 1 4 2016)  -- S 100/2016, first published 7 Mar 2016, in operation 1 Apr 2016
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 17 1 2011)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 21 1 2011)) THEN JUST (Date 21 1 2011)  -- S 20/2011, first published 17 Jan 2011, in operation 21 Jan 2011
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 2 10 2009)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 2 10 2009)) THEN JUST (Date 2 10 2009)  -- S 461/2009, first published 2 Oct 2009, in operation 2 Oct 2009
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 15 5 2006)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 6 2006)) THEN JUST (Date 1 6 2006)  -- S 263/2006, first published 15 May 2006, in operation 1 Jun 2006
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 10 11 2005)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 11 11 2005)) THEN JUST (Date 11 11 2005)  -- S 707/2005, first published 10 Nov 2005, in operation 11 Nov 2005
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2003)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2003)) THEN JUST (Date 1 1 2003)  -- 2002 Revised Edition
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 18 9 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 18 9 2001)) THEN JUST (Date 18 9 2001)  -- S 450/2001, first published 18 Sep 2001, in operation 18 Sep 2001
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 8 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 9 7 2001)) THEN JUST (Date 9 7 2001)  -- S 374/2001, first published 1 Aug 2001, deemed in operation 9 Jul 2001 (it replaces S 339/2001, cancelled by S 373/2001)
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 9 7 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 9 7 2001)) THEN JUST (Date 9 7 2001)  -- S 339/2001, first published 9 Jul 2001, in operation 9 Jul 2001, published in error
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) THEN JUST (Date 2 3 2001)  -- S 114/2001, the Regulations as made, first published 2 Mar 2001, in operation 2 Mar 2001
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `Rg 6`

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Rg 6: the effective day of the version of the Regulations that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 29 8 2023)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 9 2023)) THEN JUST (Date 1 9 2023)  -- S 589/2023, first published 29 Aug 2023, in operation 1 Sep 2023 (reg 5, the citation updates, deemed from 31 Dec 2021: see sgta-i-rg6-amendments.l4)
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 31 10 2014)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 11 2014)) THEN JUST (Date 1 11 2014)  -- S 725/2014, first published 31 Oct 2014, in operation 1 Nov 2014
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 23 6 2014)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 23 6 2014)) THEN JUST (Date 23 6 2014)  -- S 414/2014, first published 23 Jun 2014, in operation 23 Jun 2014
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 24 4 2013)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 25 4 2013)) THEN JUST (Date 25 4 2013)  -- S 251/2013, first published 24 Apr 2013, in operation 25 Apr 2013
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 4 2011)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 4 2011)) THEN JUST (Date 1 4 2011)  -- S 178/2011, first published 1 Apr 2011, in operation 1 Apr 2011
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 8 4 2010)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 15 4 2010)) THEN JUST (Date 15 4 2010)  -- S 210/2010, first published 8 Apr 2010, in operation 15 Apr 2010
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 23 7 2007)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 23 7 2007)) THEN JUST (Date 23 7 2007)  -- S 396/2007, first published 23 Jul 2007, in operation 23 Jul 2007
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 20 7 2005)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 21 7 2005)) THEN JUST (Date 21 7 2005)  -- S 478/2005, first published 20 Jul 2005, in operation 21 Jul 2005
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2005)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2005)) THEN JUST (Date 1 1 2005)  -- 2004 Revised Edition
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 27 9 2004)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 10 2004)) THEN JUST (Date 1 10 2004)  -- S 593/2004, first published 27 Sep 2004, in operation 1 Oct 2004
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 3 2 2004)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 3 2 2004)) THEN JUST (Date 3 2 2004)  -- S 48/2004, first published 3 Feb 2004, in operation 3 Feb 2004
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 2 4 2003)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 2 4 2003)) THEN JUST (Date 2 4 2003)  -- S 185/2003 as made, first published 2 Apr 2003, in operation 2 Apr 2003 (sgta-i-rg6-as-made.l4)
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Added 2026-11-04 (follow-up list): the 1999 Revised Editions of the TAS-era regulations that the Telecommunications Act 1999 continued, and the 2024 instruments.
-- Rg 3 (1999 Ed.) and Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) are NOT the "Rg 3" and "Rg 6" of the tables above and below: Cap. 323, Rg 3 (1999 Ed.) is the Radio-communication Regulations (revoked by reg 80(1) of S 114/2001, in operation 2 March 2001); Cap. 323, Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) is the
-- Telecommunication (Dealers) Regulations, replaced by the Dealers Regulations 2003 (Rg 6).  Each answers from 1 December 1999 (the Telecommunications Act 1999 came into operation; s 98(2) continues them).  The published day is the day of the Revised Edition, 1 July 1999 (assumed: the PDF
-- prints "1.7.1999" and "REVISED EDITION 1999 (1.7.1999)" and no separate publication day).  The Rg 3 (1999 Ed.) table ends on 1 March 2001 (read from reg 80(1) of S 114/2001); the Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) table's end, 1 April 2003, is read from reg 26 and reg 1 of S 185/2003 (sgta-i-rg6-as-made.l4); S 362/2001 (first published 30 Jul 2001, in operation 1 Aug 2001) is its one amendment held.

§ `Rg 3 (1999 Ed.)`

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Rg 3 (1999 Ed.): the effective day of the version of the Regulations that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 7 1999)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 12 1999)) AND (`conduct day` LESS THAN (Date 2 3 2001)) THEN JUST (Date 1 12 1999)  -- 1999 Revised Edition, continued by s 98(2) from 1 Dec 1999; ended by reg 80(1) of S 114/2001
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `Rg 7 (1999 Ed.)`

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Rg 7 (1999 Ed.): the effective day of the version of the Regulations that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 30 7 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 8 2001)) AND (`conduct day` LESS THAN (Date 2 4 2003)) THEN JUST (Date 1 8 2001)  -- S 362/2001, first published 30 Jul 2001, in operation 1 Aug 2001 (reg 4(a) deemed from 21 Jan 2000: see sgta-i-rg7-1999.l4)
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 7 1999)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 12 1999)) AND (`conduct day` LESS THAN (Date 2 4 2003)) THEN JUST (Date 1 12 1999)  -- 1999 Revised Edition, continued by s 98(2) from 1 Dec 1999; the end is reg 26 of S 185/2003 (Rg 7 revoked), in operation 2 Apr 2003
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `Wiring Work Regulations 2024`

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`WW: the effective day of the version of the Regulations that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 8 11 2024)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 11 11 2024)) THEN JUST (Date 11 11 2024)  -- S 852/2024, first published 8 Nov 2024, in operation 11 Nov 2024
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 28 6 2024)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 7 2024)) THEN JUST (Date 1 7 2024)  -- S 559/2024, first published 28 Jun 2024, in operation 1 Jul 2024
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `S 381/2024 (in-vehicle unit exemption)`

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`S 381/2024: the effective day of the version of the Notification that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 30 4 2024)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 30 4 2024)) THEN JUST (Date 30 4 2024)  -- first published 30 Apr 2024 at 5 pm, in operation 30 Apr 2024
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `Comp Regs`

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Comp Regs: the effective day of the version of the Regulations that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day, for the 2024 amendment` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 28 6 2024)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 7 2024)) THEN JUST (Date 1 7 2024)  -- S 560/2024, first published 28 Jun 2024, in operation 1 Jul 2024
           OTHERWISE NOTHING
